<title>JAPAN: Tokyo rubber futures market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Tokyo rubber futures market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo rubber futures market is closed for a national holiday on Wednesday. Trading will resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, benchmark June was up 1.3 yen per kg at 147.1 yen. -- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
